   Acesso em: 06 ago. 2026.\n   — Delimitação das camadas: MCP (transporte/ferramentas), RAG/GraphRAG (conhecimento),\n   Agentes (orquestração autônoma).\n\n10. DIGITAL APPLIED. *AI workflow orchestration platforms: 2026 comparison*. 2026.\n    Disponível em: https://www.digitalapplied.com/blog/ai-workflow-orchestration-platforms-comparison.\n    Acesso em: 06 ago. 2026.\n    — Comparativo LangGraph, CrewAI e convergência do ecossistema; observabilidade e\n    Agent Protocol como critérios.", "urls": ["https://infranodus.com/docs/mcp-vs-rag-vs-ai-agents.", "https://www.digitalapplied.com/blog/ai-workflow-orchestration-platforms-comparison."], "id": "B0006", "tokens": {"frente": 1, "arquitetura": 1, "sistemas": 1, "agentes": 2, "infranodus": 1, "engineering": 1, "mcp": 2, "rag": 2, "agents": 1, "differences": 1, "and": 1, "how": 1, "they": 1, "work": 1, "together": 1, "2026": 5, "disponivel": 2, "https": 2, "infranodus.com": 1, "docs": 1, "mcp-vs-rag-vs-ai-agents": 1, "acesso": 2, "ago": 2, "delimitacao": 1, "camadas": 1, "transporte": 1, "ferramentas": 1, "graphrag": 1, "conhecimento": 1, "orquestracao": 1, "autonoma": 1, "10": 1, "digital": 1, "applied": 1, "workflow": 1, "orchestration": 1, "platforms": 1, "comparison": 1, "www.digitalapplied.com": 1, "blog": 1, "ai-workflow-orchestration-platforms-comparison": 1, "comparativo": 1, "langgraph": 1, "crewai": 1, "convergencia": 1, "ecossistema": 1, "observabilidade": 1, "agent": 1, "protocol": 1, "criterios": 1}, "norma": 12.799677482951846}, {"arquivo": "dossie_11-engenheiro-aidd.md", "titulo": "Frente 3 — Portfólio de engenheiro de software/IA", "texto": "11. DATAEXPERT.IO. *Ultimate guide to AI engineering portfolios*. 2026. Disponível em:\n    https://www.dataexpert.io/blog/ultimate-guide-ai-engineering-portfolios.\n    Acesso em: 06 ago. 2026.\n    — Portfólios superam currículos; 3-5 projetos de ponta a ponta; métricas de impacto\n    e demos interativas.\n\n12. JACKSON, Natalia (HYPERSKILL). *Building a developer portfolio in 2026: what\n    actually gets attention*. 2026. Disponível em:\n    https://hyperskill.org/blog/post/building-a-developer-portfolio-in-2026-what-actually-gets-attention.\n    Acesso em: 06 ago. 2026.\n    — Código original vs clones de tutorial; histórico de commits iterativos; README\n    como documentação técnica com autocrítica.\n\n13. ZENCODER. *How to create a software engineer portfolio in 2026*. 2026. Disponível\n    em: https://zencoder.ai/blog/how-to-create-software-engineer-portfolio.\n    Acesso em: 06 ago. 2026.\n    — Presença digital 24/7; IA como aceleradora, mas compreensão arquitetural como\n    prova de senioridade.", "urls": ["https://hyperskill.org/blog/post/building-a-developer-portfolio-in-2026-what-actually-gets-attention.", "https://www.dataexpert.io/blog/ultimate-guide-ai-engineering-portfolios.", "https://zencoder.ai/blog/how-to-create-software-engineer-portfolio."], "id": "B0007", "tokens": {"frente": 1, "portfolio": 3, "engenheiro": 1, "software": 2, "11": 1, "dataexpert.io": 1, "ultimate": 1, "guide": 1, "engineering": 1, "portfolios": 2, "2026": 8, "disponivel": 3, "https": 3, "www.dataexpert.io": 1, "blog": 3, "ultimate-guide-ai-engineering-portfolios": 1, "acesso": 3, "ago": 3, "superam": 1, "curriculos": 1, "3-5": 1, "projetos": 1, "ponta": 2, "metricas": 1, "impacto": 1, "demos": 1, "interativas": 1, "12": 1, "jackson": 1, "natalia": 1, "hyperskill": 1, "building": 1, "developer": 1, "what": 1, "actually": 1, "gets": 1, "attention": 1, "hyperskill.org": 1, "post": 1, "building-a-developer-portfolio-in-2026-what-actually-gets-attention": 1, "codigo": 1, "original": 1, "clones": 1, "tutorial": 1, "historico": 1, "commits": 1, "iterativos": 1, "readme": 1, "documentacao": 1, "tecnica": 1, "autocritica": 1, "13": 1, "zencoder": 1, "how": 1, "create": 1, "engineer": 1, "zencoder.ai": 1, "how-to-create-software-engineer-portfolio": 1, "presenca": 1, "digital": 1, "aceleradora": 1, "compreensao": 1, "arquitetural": 1, "p